    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "In the lift her thoughts were on lunch and a good rest;",
      "translation": "尽管她已年迈，但她总是把她的房子和花园收拾得井井有条。",
      "startTime": 28.27,
      "endTime": 32.64,
